'''Polavaram district'''<ref>{{cite web |title=Andhra Pradesh Cabinet approves formation of two new districts, headquarters status for Madanapalle|url=https://www.newindianexpress.com/states/andhra-pradesh/2025/Dec/30/andhra-pradesh-cabinet-approves-formation-of-two-new-districts-headquarters-status-for-madanapalle |date=30 December 2025 |website=[[The New Indian Express]] |language=en }}</ref> is a district in the Indian state of [[Andhra Pradesh]]. The headquarters of the district is located at [[Rampachodavaram]].<ref>{{cite web |title=A.P. Cabinet clears district reorganisation, mandal realignment|url=https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/ap-cabinet-clears-district-reorganisation-mandal-realignment/article70450525.ece |date=29 December 2025 |website=[[The Hindu]] |language=en }}</ref>

==Etymology==
This district is named after [[Polavaram Project]] which is an under-construction multi-purpose  project on the [[Godavari River]].

== History ==
On December 31, 2025, Rampachodavaram division was carved out of [[Alluri Sitharama Raju district]]. Earlier the district region was part of [[East Godavari district]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Andhra Pradesh Cabinet approves formation of two new districts, headquarters status for Madanapalle|url=https://www.newindianexpress.com/states/andhra-pradesh/2025/Dec/30/andhra-pradesh-cabinet-approves-formation-of-two-new-districts-headquarters-status-for-madanapalle |date=30 December 2025 |website=[[The New Indian Express]] |language=en }}</ref>

== Administrative divisions ==
[[File:Bhupathipalem Reservoir aerial view 05.jpg|alt=Bhupathipalem Reservoir aerial view|thumb|Bhupathipalem Reservoir aerial view|left]]
The district is divided into two revenue divisions, namely [[Rampachodavaram revenue division|Rampachodavaram]] and [[Chinturu revenue division|Chinturu]].<ref>{{cite web |title=AP Issues GO Creating Polavaram District With Rampachodavaram as Headquarters
|url=https://www.deccanchronicle.com/southern-states/andhra-pradesh/ap-issues-go-creating-polavaram-district-with-rampachodavaram-as-headquarters-1927331|date=30 December 2025 |website=[[Deccan Chronicle]] |language=en }}</ref> These revenue divisions are further subdivided into a total of 12 mandals, each administered by a Tahsildar.

